14
00:00:39,762 --> 00:00:44,351
Nokia's story began long before smartphones existed.

15
00:00:43,785 --> 00:00:48,426
Founded in Finland in 1865, the company

16
00:00:48,426 --> 00:00:53,741
originally operated as a paper mill. Over

17
00:00:53,368 --> 00:00:58,668
time, Nokia expanded into different industries, including

18
00:00:58,668 --> 00:01:01,863
rubber, cables, and electronics. But its biggest

19
